<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 14.5 pct yr/yr in Sept.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 14.5 pct yr/yr in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 14.5 percent year on year in September against a revised 14.1 percent in August, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.589 trillion baht in September from a revised 3.546 trillion in August.</p>
<p>    M-2			Sept 96     Aug 96	  Sept 95</p>
<p>    Money supply	     3.589	3.546	    3.135</p>
<p>    Percentage change     14.5	 14.1		18.4</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said September figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
